1cP\u00f4nei\u201d descreve um tipo de cavalo de pequeno porte, n\u00e3o seu sexo ou idade.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7d61-a7af-38fee186f7b3","description":"Potra","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-777c-92cf-352a1202b86f","description":"P\u00f4nei","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7011-bf73-532302fca714","description":"Garanh\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7359-ac19-5bab0577e430","description":"\u00c9gua","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7eef-8bbb-04be432787ad","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem escreveu \u201cUma Breve Hist\u00f3ria do Tempo\u201d?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O livro de divulga\u00e7\u00e3o cient\u00edfica de Stephen Hawking explora o Big Bang, os buracos negros e a natureza do tempo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7d5c-b5bc-a49eead6c35f","description":"Stephen Hawking","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7817-86dc-f5909c715e04","description":"Albert Einstein","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7446-a22b-185e97411401","description":"Richard Feynman","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-73fb-ad4e-71657dff8142","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7e2c-bf3a-eaf65576063a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem descobriu as leis da gravidade?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A lei da gravita\u00e7\u00e3o universal de Isaac Newton explicou tanto a queda dos objetos quanto o movimento dos planetas, com base nos trabalhos anteriores de Kepler e Galileu.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a72-9ee2-1c1209d6bb06","description":"Isaac Newton","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-727b-999a-81b83035b431","description":"Christiaan Huygens","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-75e5-9701-0070197cb97a","description":"Johannes Kepler","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-78a3-9be4-0fe8c7d2d42f","description":"Galileu Galilei","correct_ans