"Camale\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7552-bc14-6955583779b5","description":"Lagartinha-de-p\u00e9-macio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7e4b-8a52-0ae09d45ff44","description":"Iguana","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-73ba-a217-5acd7c59a183","description":"Lagartixa-turca","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-758e-a7b7-94d3783c52eb","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama um pequeno terremoto ou tremor que ocorre ap\u00f3s um grande terremoto?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os tremores secund\u00e1rios resultam da adapta\u00e7\u00e3o da crosta terrestre \u00e0s mudan\u00e7as de tens\u00e3o causadas por um grande terremoto e podem durar dias ou mais.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7512-a3c0-226c50d7bfee","description":"Um tremor secund\u00e1rio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a47-bda2-57d87be48948","description":"Um precursor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7eb0-99c2-fcb3a84c31a6","description":"Um tremor","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7181-a849-04c4fe56f4f2","description":"Uma onda s\u00edsmica","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7241-aa89-00d2bcff96a2","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 uma crista de areia formada pelo ac\u00famulo causado pelo vento?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma duna pode migrar \u00e0 medida que o vento transporta gr\u00e3os de areia por uma encosta e os deposita no lado protegido.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a1a-a079-dc86756648b6","description":"Duna","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7445-aec1-e4535fc9e392","description":"Penhasco","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-72de-8b32-467e10e9571b","description":"C\u00e2nion","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-79c6-8873-fedd07bdbbde","description":"Planalto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a5b-8c4d-530fc5cbd7a4","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a