nidades muito menores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7fd5-bd43-d3c22daa8862","description":"Um ano-luz","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-76e3-9011-cdd1120fa478","description":"Um quil\u00f4metro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7299-bc89-87910c688f65","description":"Um parsec","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7ccc-a428-79a6e78c4339","description":"Um metro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7fed-a40a-6a0d61dd1d21","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"A que classe de animais pertencem os morcegos?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os morcegos s\u00e3o mam\u00edferos: as f\u00eameas amamentam seus filhotes com leite, mesmo que os morcegos possam voar.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7d54-87f8-28789e802fa8","description":"Mam\u00edferos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-78a7-bc09-f5a507811a7c","description":"Insetos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-79d0-8531-b00492a90544","description":"R\u00e9pteis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7d33-8b69-9c15b0900726","description":"Aves","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7dc2-b46b-0675d0768a00","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quantos n\u00fameros primos existem entre 1 e 10, inclusive?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Existem quatro: 2, 3, 5 e 7. Um deles n\u00e3o \u00e9 primo, e 2 \u00e9 o \u00fanico primo par.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-773a-819c-4f3de5c3664d","description":"4","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7e37-a415-ffa8d692c610","description":"5","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7c01-abed-9e10d4a4e469","description":"6","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7bce-83d6-77f95ff6bbe8","description":"7","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7f30-8292-95b48370ec34","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual dessas plantas \u00e9 carn\u00edvora?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A planta-mosca de V\u0