{"id":"01a21904-ae01-797e-ac89-a5b067d9433d","description":"3,14","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7d82-8af5-6602497ad462","description":"3,41","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-72d7-9ada-e5b813afcb14","description":"4,31","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7559-a097-f9e1f1d562ec","description":"1,34","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-783e-8417-70337c7b3f0d","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 usado como desinfetante em piscinas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O cloro ajuda a eliminar micr\u00f3bios nocivos da \u00e1gua da piscina. O cheiro forte e caracter\u00edstico das piscinas geralmente vem das cloraminas, formadas quando o cloro reage com contaminantes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7325-8127-a01f53a5b46e","description":"Cloro","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-71b0-b7f3-3a140ab95949","description":"Enxofre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-706f-815c-a67e187b0aed","description":"Carbono","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-75ba-ad5e-ec83a4377cc1","description":"Cobalto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-71b6-b5cb-f92461aa59ad","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que os submarinos utilizam para observar a superf\u00edcie a partir de uma posi\u00e7\u00e3o oculta?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um perisc\u00f3pio redireciona a luz, permitindo que algu\u00e9m veja por cima de um obst\u00e1culo enquanto permanece oculto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7627-ba7c-1ff6cc3b2afc","description":"Perisc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7f7b-adf5-df40bd374eba","description":"Episc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-72df-8e14-b534f1809748","description":"Estrobosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7ced-a862-8e2697481c4f","description":"Estetosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7fbd-876b-7f2862d5c2f1","category":"01a2135e-