0236099","description":"Isaac Newton","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a12-b577-9dc35d83cdf0","description":"Galileu Galilei","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-725e-b52a-588c3d91cf05","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual termo se refere a objetos ou retas que est\u00e3o lado a lado e nunca se cruzam?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As retas paralelas mant\u00eam a mesma dist\u00e2ncia entre si; as retas perpendiculares se encontram em um \u00e2ngulo reto, enquanto as retas convergentes se aproximam uma da outra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7bbb-87f5-e058e71167cd","description":"Paralelas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7471-bb99-581167382e08","description":"Perpendiculares","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-77d6-94d3-415887339244","description":"Diagonal","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7d55-94a9-d655d2a31c83","description":"Convergente","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-731c-89cf-6f57b0a901da","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"As iguanas marinhas, os crocodilos de \u00e1gua salgada, as cobras marinhas e as tartarugas marinhas pertencem a qual classe de animais?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os r\u00e9pteis s\u00e3o vertebrados que respiram ar e possuem escamas. As tartarugas-marinhas precisam subir \u00e0 superf\u00edcie para respirar, enquanto as iguanas marinhas conseguem prender a respira\u00e7\u00e3o debaixo d\u2019\u00e1gua.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7714-8750-a4cddaee4ab2","description":"R\u00e9pteis","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7daa-8006-4c853486861f","description":"Mam\u00edferos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-72e4-801e-3567122bda13","description":"Anf\u00edbios","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7b1e-9dad-1f5061cf9f6e","description":"Peixes","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7365-8958-a0e55152e51f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de coruja?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um \u201cowlet\u201d \u00e9 um filhote de coruja; a termina\u00e7\u00e3o -let geralmente indica algo pequeno ou jovem, como em \u201cpiglet\u201d (leit\u00e3o).","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-729e-8d3a-0de783ca8bcb","description":"Um filhote de coruja","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7dc3-83ec-6e071c8d60d8","description":"Uma lagarta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7ec6-abe0-901cddefe5e4","description":"Um codling","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7518-bf0f-c2e78af3068c","description":"Um potro","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7ca7-840b-325047263524","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama uma borboleta jovem?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A lagarta \u00e9 o est\u00e1gio larval da borboleta; depois de crescer, ela forma uma cris\u00e1lida e, mais tarde, emerge como adulto.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-723c-81eb-026ee55d74de","description":"Uma lagarta","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7f91-8fd1-c29ebcc71929","description":"Um gatinho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7946-854c-96fda8bc10d2","description":"Um pintinho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-796a-b8bc-eb47c7220887","description":"Uma aranha beb\u00ea","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7ee0-b228-7c00a3d83874","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"De que tipo de \u00e1rvore v\u00eam tanto as t\u00e2maras quanto os cocos?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As tamareiras e os coqueiros s\u00e3o esp\u00e9cies diferentes da fam\u00edlia das palmeiras, que tamb\u00e9m inclui muitas plantas ornamentais e produtoras de \u00f3leo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7893-8c65-b99a360134fd","description":"Palmeira","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7c54-a39f-ed8234ff56b4","description":"Bordo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-78ad-9f39-938d9603ee9a","description":"B\u00e9tula","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-739e-9f07-f8c7e8b87d09","description":"Abeto","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7f0c-8a57-2a7d0ed79579","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual fruta apresenta seus aqu\u00eanios (ov\u00e1rios com sementes) na parte externa?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A polpa vermelha \u00e9 um recept\u00e1culo floral aumentado; cada aqu\u00eanio \u00e9 um pequeno fruto seco que cont\u00e9m uma semente.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7bd5-bb7b-e378cba4f773","description":"Morango","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7b65-89d8-686c3bc196de","description":"Ma\u00e7\u00e3","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-74c3-8686-33395f798774","description":"Uva","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a96-9b6e-4dce5f415519","description":"Banana","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-73cb-b55f-2517b810ff26","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar um grupo de le\u00f5es?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma alcateia geralmente inclui f\u00eameas aparentadas, seus filhotes e um ou mais machos adultos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-76e3-925c-17317d2b9f25","description":"Uma alcateia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7071-9ddb-c0bc0e2d5b3f","description":"Um rebanho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-776f-a577-b735fa2b2b65","description":"Um clowder","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7ec9-ba8f-00924802bfd4","description":"Uma shrewdness","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7281-a18b-a828de258c2f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o maior planeta do sistema solar?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"J\u00fapiter \u00e9 um gigante gasoso, e sua Grande Mancha Vermelha \u00e9 maior do que a Terra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7741-b957-6824c47aae96","description":"J\u00fapiter","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-79de-961f-53f715d62be6","description":"Saturno","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-73d5-a062-26165720e708","description":"Terra","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7fe2-b494-69a125323848","description":"Urano","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a67-bbd4-d18cc391ab1f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o processo pelo qual tanto o leite quanto o sangue podem se tornar semiss\u00f3lidos?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A coagula\u00e7\u00e3o ocorre quando a fibrina forma uma rede no sangue; no leite, as prote\u00ednas se aglomeram formando coalhada, como na fabrica\u00e7\u00e3o de queijo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-70bc-a7be-d41e3adf0ad5","description":"Coagula\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7b36-b4a7-c7e1606a74b7","description":"Pasteuriza\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-78a9-b1f4-6a4181c4e3b9","description":"Filtra\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-790f-b39a-d112c4718a28","description":"Destila\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-794d-9a17-114be4a458a0","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o termo para um mineral que cont\u00e9m metal?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um min\u00e9rio cont\u00e9m material valioso o suficiente para que a extra\u00e7\u00e3o valha a pena; nem toda rocha que cont\u00e9m metal se enquadra nessa defini\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7b90-b974-d200899b9f72","description":"Min\u00e9rio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7e72-98e8-607910148fca","description":"Turfa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7100-88c7-735a956696d6","description":"Pedra","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7b97-ab0f-dd7645c94fb6","description":"Cimento","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7b47-81b4-a4d9b8a19b8c","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama uma f\u00eamea de veado?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma \u201cdoe\u201d tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 uma coelha adulta; um veado macho adulto \u00e9 chamado de \u201cbuck\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7ca6-86bc-5a98125978c1","description":"Uma cor\u00e7a","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7df8-ab1c-61cc22599f08","description":"Um cercado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-722e-899b-b00e0817d94e","description":"Uma \u00e9gua","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7638-bf98-66cc7c900b47","description":"Uma cabra","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7c5c-bc19-e00b42e725b6","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que tipo de organismo \u00e9 uma sanguessuga?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A sanguessuga \u00e9 um parasita, pois se alimenta de um hospedeiro; muitas esp\u00e9cies usam ventosas para se fixar nos animais.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-71fa-ba7b-3d8602f68f1e","description":"Parasita","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7cb0-a944-18e6bc112a07","description":"Herb\u00edvoro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7bcb-985f-78792ce00e76","description":"On\u00edvoro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a73-b12b-8a2e497e704b","description":"Decompositor","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7606-afee-68f119d6258f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a maior cobra?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As anacondas s\u00e3o geralmente consideradas as maiores cobras em termos de peso, embora as p\u00edtons reticuladas possam atingir comprimentos maiores.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae01-72c8-a219-d38b1d30dc06","description":"Anaconda","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7df9-8728-9e5271bf7122","description":"Mamba-preta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-7a32-bf99-f6a06b57d7fa","description":"Cascavel","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-79d2-9d2a-3a344eeee395","description":"Cobra-real","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae01-711e-9f82-04247fad14be","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que tipo de figura pode ser obtusa ou is\u00f3sceles?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A soma dos \u00e2ngulos de um tri\u00e2ngulo \u00e9 de 180 graus; \u201cobtusa\u201d descreve um \u00e2ngulo maior que 90 graus, enquanto \u201cis\u00f3sceles\u201d significa que dois lados s\u00e3o iguais.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-78c3-ad1a-b2e992de4b1d","description":"Um tri\u00e2ngulo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f07-8626-f60d465f8749","description":"Um quadrado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-77e2-adc8-0e37d39ad9ad","description":"Um c\u00edrculo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c95-b474-e978e5010f5c","description":"Um ret\u00e2ngulo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-750a-9bbd-85b063091f24","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 feito de cascalho, areia, cimento e \u00e1gua?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O concreto endurece \u00e0 medida que o cimento reage com a \u00e1gua, unindo a areia e o cascalho.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-769e-8ac6-d22b276b585c","description":"Concreto","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c93-8a4e-572a7c6779a5","description":"Porcelana","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a12-bd3d-1b7a80392deb","description":"Gesso","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a24-b088-2d97bbb19e11","description":"Giz","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a85-82d8-c8e87b9e7c7f","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quantos membros um polvo tem?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um polvo tem 8 membros, geralmente chamados de bra\u00e7os. Eles n\u00e3o t\u00eam ossos, o que ajuda o animal a se espremer por espa\u00e7os estreitos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-767a-b606-a496a6fa0fc2","description":"8","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-794f-8832-8e2b94bd707b","description":"6","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7320-99b3-ea23b11c0de7","description":"10","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b46-b392-5689bb04b5f8","description":"14","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-734f-897b-a65123e7d8ab","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"A qu\u00edmica da vida gira em torno de qual elemento?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O carbono possui quatro el\u00e9trons de val\u00eancia, o que lhe permite formar liga\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e1veis com muitos elementos e construir as cadeias e os an\u00e9is encontrados nas biomol\u00e9culas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d5f-bd3a-bb5550664c48","description":"Carbono","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a3c-96da-cb2b8769453a","description":"F\u00f3sforo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7708-9eb7-ba8227812bc7","description":"Magn\u00e9sio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f2f-957a-905d5fa31410","description":"L\u00edtio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7935-9776-3b22b09c4104","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual escala \u00e9 usada para classificar a magnitude dos terremotos?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Charles F. Richter e Beno Gutenberg introduziram a escala em 1935. Trata-se de uma escala logar\u00edtmica; portanto, cada aumento de um n\u00famero inteiro representa um aumento de dez vezes na amplitude da onda medida.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7111-bda4-0b476f44af5f","description":"Richter","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-73e2-89aa-d320e0c0b6b4","description":"Beaufort","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ddd-8c4f-9d5347fc4f22","description":"Schweizer","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7644-85ca-41a8e45ea303","description":"Hammer","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-744e-a4a5-431053155c18","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual organismo se ali