c-48b739fc8fa8","description":"Pombo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7268-8e22-a543db0a6b8a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a unidade de medida linear?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O metro \u00e9 definido com base na velocidade da luz no v\u00e1cuo: a luz percorre um metro em 1\/299.792.458 de segundo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7249-8065-31cb963f42d9","description":"Metro","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-79e1-ad7e-a3a5b5927ae6","description":"Decibel","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7200-ae18-515754bd5b1b","description":"Coulomb","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-74b3-803d-d981fd0ff043","description":"Ampere","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7960-a259-9b9f451fa994","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que significa a quarta letra da sigla \u201cNASA\u201d?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A quarta letra significa \u201cAdministra\u00e7\u00e3o\u201d, completando a sigla \u201cAdministra\u00e7\u00e3o Nacional de Aeron\u00e1utica e Espa\u00e7o\u201d. A NASA foi fundada em 1958 para liderar o programa espacial civil dos Estados Unidos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7fd3-8a73-d5ac546c543f","description":"Administra\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-71e3-85e7-2868a28a3e20","description":"Aberra\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7486-b57b-2d3f67349cd4","description":"Acr\u00e9scimo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e15-8c5c-58c05a4fa038","description":"Alocu\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7370-9b9b-c4a390e7028a","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quanto tempo dura uma gravidez humana?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma gravidez t\u00edpica dura cerca de 40 semanas, contadas a partir do primeiro dia da \u00faltima menstrua\u00e7\u00e3o, embora o momento do parto possa variar.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2