m o Big Bang?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O Big Bang foi a expans\u00e3o do Universo primitivo, n\u00e3o uma explos\u00e3o em um espa\u00e7o vazio pr\u00e9-existente.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b8d-a985-563e3dd772ba","description":"O Universo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7084-b94e-e6d4a52d88cb","description":"A Via L\u00e1ctea","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e02-afe4-fb5f78f8d514","description":"Andr\u00f4meda","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-75e9-ac22-4d5708f78d4f","description":"Infinito","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7198-a8e4-76fb99e200a2","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama uma \u00e9gua?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma \u00e9gua \u00e9 uma f\u00eamea adulta; uma f\u00eamea jovem \u00e9 chamada de potranca.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7482-acb4-546e5de491cf","description":"Uma \u00e9gua","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c78-9a0f-fa932545bc84","description":"Uma galinha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-770a-8ed3-e3c1fb8b86ab","description":"Uma f\u00eamea","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-736d-89f1-9e0ce2674a1c","description":"Uma Jill","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-72a2-94d3-205392bdd213","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar uma cadela?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"\u201cBitch\u201d tamb\u00e9m \u00e9 o termo usado para designar uma loba ou uma raposa f\u00eamea.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7538-b01c-27a882375851","description":"Uma cadela","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-77e4-9ed5-8155de968821","description":"Uma Jill","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-79ff-b24e-69b75ceb8fc9","description":"Um ganso macho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d75-8860-9d332043712a","description":"Uma tigresa","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-717e-abbf-167fd27d7f82","category":"01a