energia para os processos nas c\u00e9lulas eucari\u00f3ticas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-78ee-8bfd-1aaa9433d4b4","description":"Nas c\u00e9lulas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f7a-a841-03812f689e77","description":"Nos v\u00edrus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7cb5-90d4-7966196ab34f","description":"No n\u00facleo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-75fa-918b-79dd4d4b5413","description":"No plasma sangu\u00edneo","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e9f-8766-458f650d0756","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 um \u00edon?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um \u00edon possui um n\u00famero desigual de pr\u00f3tons e el\u00e9trons, o que lhe confere uma carga l\u00edquida; o ganho ou a perda de el\u00e9trons cria esse desequil\u00edbrio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f51-b070-2f44a13d9b20","description":"Um \u00e1tomo ou mol\u00e9cula com carga el\u00e9trica","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-741d-9f46-cdc9172c4f1f","description":"Um \u00e1tomo sem carga el\u00e9trica","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7483-b4ec-8faefc7e0259","description":"Uma liga\u00e7\u00e3o qu\u00edmica entre dois \u00e1tomos","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-75c6-aa07-6f75f45923e1","description":"Uma part\u00edcula de luz","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a9d-8be1-4fb1f0c4abc1","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que a parasitologia estuda?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A parasitologia estuda os parasitas e suas rela\u00e7\u00f5es com os organismos nos quais vivem, chamados de hospedeiros.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f9b-8f03-7b5d14f47045","description":"parasitas","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c80-8a7b-49f80667c98d","description":"crime","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7333-a850-eafaf7966ad8","description":"nutri\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7545-946