mulada de radia\u00e7\u00e3o\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7337-93f3-0cfa63760025","description":"Luz","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-702d-a259-224101eab856","description":"Baixa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b04-bcdc-f87604c8753d","description":"Longa","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7bcc-8ab4-edbe3f07f14b","description":"Grande","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7db9-888a-08ebe9696231","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quanto tempo a Terra leva para orbitar o Sol?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A \u00f3rbita da Terra leva cerca de 365,25 dias; portanto, os dias bissextos ajudam a manter o calend\u00e1rio alinhado com as esta\u00e7\u00f5es do ano.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-72bd-8fc1-931306929c86","description":"1 ano","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ab6-bb14-e06665b181d5","description":"1 dia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a7c-adfc-c323fb443454","description":"28 dias","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-72a7-9b08-f3544139158d","description":"1 m\u00eas","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-713d-9972-354ee1a68980","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama uma figura geom\u00e9trica com tr\u00eas lados?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Na geometria euclidiana, a soma dos \u00e2ngulos internos de um tri\u00e2ngulo \u00e9 igual a 180 graus, e seus tr\u00eas lados fazem dele o pol\u00edgono mais simples.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-79d7-844e-a6ddbbf5e36a","description":"Tri\u00e2ngulo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-76c9-8bde-52ece896d552","description":"Quadrado","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c89-9e29-8097356d48b0","description":"Paralelogramo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-762f-a644-219d9172215c","description":"Trapezoide","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-78dc-8fb2-5ced013def4c","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que g\u00e1s \u00e9 produzido durante a combust\u00e3o incompleta do carv\u00e3o vegetal?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O mon\u00f3xido de carbono se forma quando um combust\u00edvel que cont\u00e9m carbono queima com oxig\u00eanio insuficiente. Ele \u00e9 perigoso porque se liga \u00e0 hemoglobina e reduz a capacidade do sangue de transportar oxig\u00eanio.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-73c0-a86c-26c25973cd9a","description":"Mon\u00f3xido de carbono","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-78b5-af46-2610209edceb","description":"Di\u00f3xido de carbono","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-76e5-9b3a-c696c72803a6","description":"Metano","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-744a-9972-ac72de1afd35","description":"Nitrog\u00eanio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7394-bb6d-7bbf0e2ea7cf","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Em que parte da garganta humana est\u00e1 localizada a epiglote?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A laringe abriga a epiglote, uma aba cartilaginosa que ajuda a impedir que alimentos e l\u00edquidos entrem nas vias respirat\u00f3rias durante a degluti\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-70b5-823f-978b47b46196","description":"Laringe (caixa vocal)","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-73e6-b560-217df3040cf3","description":"Orelha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a1f-b94f-a0a7251a56a4","description":"Est\u00f4mago","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b8f-9712-c95a4ab2ce8e","description":"F\u00edgado","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-785b-aa53-5d6e0b2e2b3b","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual das seguintes part\u00edculas N\u00c3O possui carga el\u00e9trica?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os neutrinos s\u00e3o eletricamente neutros e apresentam os tipos el\u00e9tron, m\u00faon e tau; os el\u00e9trons, m\u00faons e taus, por sua vez, possuem carga el\u00e9trica.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7de8-be4c-5c8dba9684f9","description":"Neutrino","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-70a0-80fa-6b7f76108802","description":"El\u00e9tron","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-74fa-a0da-4c742cba927f","description":"M\u00faon","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7da7-ab29-5d6d88bbc2cf","description":"Tau","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f36-b866-cbea1a6c3f5e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o termo usado para designar algu\u00e9m que estuda f\u00edsica?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um f\u00edsico investiga a mat\u00e9ria, a energia, o movimento e as for\u00e7as; um m\u00e9dico exerce a medicina.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-797f-8e3d-5030ce33c485","description":"F\u00edsico","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-75ea-aa69-e89c96bf0f24","description":"M\u00e9dico","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f1d-b859-da452b7184c9","description":"Fisiatra","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7017-b0d3-0ea7c2a0095f","description":"Fisicalista","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-78b3-bc28-832926593bae","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual era o primeiro nome do f\u00edsico Newton?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Isaac Newton tamb\u00e9m construiu um dos primeiros telesc\u00f3pios refletores pr\u00e1ticos, que utilizava espelhos em vez de lentes para formar uma imagem.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e54-8ccc-869a18b5c791","description":"Isaac","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-70d0-b54b-ab003f4bf38a","description":"Albert","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-78ba-b084-ca4306f365c5","description":"Herbert","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e3a-8712-e7c2314998c3","description":"Luigi","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-73c3-ba22-998e77efe7d8","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome da gema vermelha que simbol