"description":"12","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a69-bbfd-0c4077a43e29","description":"11","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-749e-a372-91643d6e58e0","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual dessas cobras mata sua presa enrolando-se nela e apertando-a (um m\u00e9todo chamado constri\u00e7\u00e3o)?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As p\u00edtons s\u00e3o constritoras n\u00e3o venenosas que se enrolam na presa e a apertam; cobras, cascav\u00e9is e v\u00edboras-sopadoras dependem do veneno.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-759b-b386-c75ac9b3eb43","description":"P\u00edton","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7fd3-97ad-cf4795e537d4","description":"Cobra","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7421-b523-e281188e68db","description":"Cascavel","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7291-9a67-cc7e2557e1c4","description":"Vipera-sopradora","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-76d4-944b-126439aba36e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que podemos medir com um transferidor?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os \u00e2ngulos s\u00e3o medidos em graus; um transferidor escolar padr\u00e3o \u00e9 graduado de 0\u00b0 a 180\u00b0.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-783a-a304-4c00aea6c13d","description":"\u00c2ngulos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-73cc-aa23-d41799624aa9","description":"Press\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-75c7-ba3a-4561b0bf5546","description":"Velocidade","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c14-8a7d-05b925e145fe","description":"For\u00e7a","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-71e9-8066-5b25ca6d9ea0","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual dessas doen\u00e7as \u00e9 caracterizada por les\u00f5es cut\u00e2neas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A hansen\u00edase \u00e9 causada por bact\u00e9rias e pode afetar tanto a pele quanto os nervos perif\u00e9ricos, causando, \u00e0s vezes, dorm\u00eancia ou fraqueza.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7cad-b6c3-a5299e4af062","description":"Hansen\u00edase","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ebb-ad32-0f1afd15b0d6","description":"Pneumonia","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7929-8da0-7f4a4d757069","description":"C\u00f3lera","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7795-80ab-3c87e816122f","description":"Gripe","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-781b-b015-0ddefec6d7ca","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual peixe tem antenas semelhantes a bigodes ao lado da boca?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O bagre usa seus barbilh\u00f5es, que cont\u00eam receptores sensoriais, para localizar alimentos, especialmente quando a visibilidade \u00e9 ruim.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7dbf-b5f8-be4bea320909","description":"Peixe-gato","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a4d-b5e1-c25c8a88c1da","description":"Cachorro-marinho","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7124-8d20-b4d1aa5ca3a0","description":"Peixe-pulm\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-74b0-8c5e-0000cd8cc22d","description":"Tubar\u00e3o-branco","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d67-9546-76f7c0a4c292","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que significa LCD?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As telas de cristal l\u00edquido (LCD) modulam a luz em vez de produzi-la em cada pixel; por isso, muitas utilizam uma luz de fundo separada.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7897-9841-fbcfe7fbfeb6","description":"Tela de cristal l\u00edquido","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-767a-b7ae-b5aaa7d13319","description":"Tela de cristal de luz","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7952-93b4-744f574fc304","description":"Tela de c\u00e1todo l\u00edquido","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7907-819c-5a87c38194fc","description":"Diodo de baixa corrente","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7293-