9 chamado de pir\u00f3lise.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-74f0-9068-1a3c83b0ec1e","description":"Carv\u00e3o vegetal","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7440-ba6d-c33c3763ae06","description":"\u00c2mbar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a18-adb4-a825d727e939","description":"Ouro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7919-a7e4-9e14c3a2584b","description":"Cobre","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7944-860a-2aca860c1527","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que permite que um site salve dados do usu\u00e1rio localmente no navegador?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um cookie \u00e9 um pequeno peda\u00e7o de informa\u00e7\u00e3o que um site solicita ao navegador para armazenar, geralmente para manter uma sess\u00e3o ou lembrar prefer\u00eancias.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-750e-9ab3-d71a53f38639","description":"Cookie","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b65-913f-a214ad9d6b4a","description":"Hiperlink","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-79e2-9d74-e68bc5deb5db","description":"Trilha de navega\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7418-aefa-34aeb8ac779d","description":"Faixa de op\u00e7\u00f5es","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7356-aa3a-55089990b4c4","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o \u00fanico grupo de aves capaz de voar para tr\u00e1s?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os beija-flores geram sustenta\u00e7\u00e3o tanto na batida para baixo quanto na batida para cima, o que os ajuda a pairar e manobrar em qualquer dire\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-755a-9aed-c2c290ee6b7a","description":"Beija-flores","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b7e-bc96-51e7b49147c0","description":"Kiwis","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7546-9ce4-93c162ba2704","description":"Cegonhas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e63-a243-f221a08ce3d8","description":"Papagaios"