04-ae02-7565-b04f-104e021339ec","description":"Vento solar","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7da6-85ca-ef74fb79507c","description":"Furac\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f34-97c8-505cd25d1e41","description":"Cometa","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7856-8106-393f3494d8be","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 o nome do m\u00e9todo de comunica\u00e7\u00e3o representado por uma sequ\u00eancia de pontos e tra\u00e7os?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O c\u00f3digo Morse foi criado para a telegrafia, sendo que cada letra \u00e9 representada por um padr\u00e3o distinto de sinais curtos e longos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-79a5-b9f1-00dc1d4f8b1b","description":"C\u00f3digo Morse","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ff9-8895-207b3c64efc9","description":"C\u00f3digo bin\u00e1rio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-70d7-aa52-aacc4e04aa54","description":"C\u00f3digo ASCII","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7cc0-84b7-46e452e5c4ce","description":"Unicode","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7bef-9afc-e3fae88ea1cb","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual processo desintegra a rocha no local por meio da exposi\u00e7\u00e3o ao vento, \u00e0 chuva e \u00e0s mudan\u00e7as de temperatura?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O intemperismo desintegra a rocha no local onde ela se encontra; a eros\u00e3o \u00e9 o deslocamento posterior dos fragmentos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e32-b380-c6b6fb13c45b","description":"Intemperismo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7bfd-926e-f214deef093f","description":"Deposi\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-747f-846c-2eaeea53cba2","description":"Condensa\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d28-9bfc-aeb445e0afe9","description":"Sublima\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-74ef-b9ea-49fd8e52c4e7","category":"