933","description":"Toque de sino","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7207-b364-d3d0074589c3","description":"Doen\u00e7as reum\u00e1ticas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-72c7-8387-299fe27145da","description":"S\u00edfilis","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7181-a009-4780ac5e5267","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual cientista teria se inspirado na queda de uma ma\u00e7\u00e3 para desenvolver sua teoria da gravidade?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A lei da gravita\u00e7\u00e3o universal de Isaac Newton descreve a mesma for\u00e7a que atrai uma ma\u00e7\u00e3 em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 Terra e mant\u00e9m os planetas em \u00f3rbita.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7265-9ca3-91c5da9da74f","description":"Isaac Newton","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-72dc-9650-fa76213cc359","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b11-a06e-0514e2ec9d92","description":"Galileu Galilei","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7086-be99-cb24a1a60d07","description":"Ernest Rutherford","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f4f-8e9b-72750c93892c","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a palavra para designar uma raposa f\u00eamea?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Uma raposa f\u00eamea \u00e9 chamada de \u201cvixen\u201d; a raposa macho costuma ser chamada de \u201cdog\u201d, e uma raposa jovem \u00e9 chamada de \u201ccub\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7cbe-ba48-9c085329cdbc","description":"Uma raposa f\u00eamea","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-721d-b4a2-268aec61ba12","description":"Uma ovelha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c9b-9347-01ba62aa7eaa","description":"Uma galinha","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-73da-8c28-1687900f0ae0","description":"Uma cor\u00e7a","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7405-a83a-d5b4a49e3297","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"As ra\u00e7as siamesa e birmanesa s\u00e3o de quais animais?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Os gatos da ra\u00e7a siamesa geralmente t\u00eam olhos azuis e pelagem com pontos coloridos, enquanto os gatos birmaneses costumam ter pelagem curta e brilhante.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e3b-9fb9-27a0d0ac3bed","description":"Gato","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f15-ab06-5299f208e0ca","description":"Cachorro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7dbe-a970-22619c88e7ed","description":"Burro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f66-97d9-113920ae61e1","description":"Porco","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d1b-b182-e37cfa5d1ca1","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quem \u00e9 conhecido por sua teoria da evolu\u00e7\u00e3o por sele\u00e7\u00e3o natural?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Charles Darwin apresentou sua teoria na obra \u201cA Origem das Esp\u00e9cies\u201d, com base nas observa\u00e7\u00f5es feitas durante sua viagem a bordo do HMS Beagle.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-72de-85be-3f03ddd58d66","description":"Charles Darwin","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7362-80a4-918127d54c0f","description":"Albert Einstein","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-70ba-9bf2-0040a785fbe0","description":"Niels Bohr","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-76a4-ab90-0963f53f2756","description":"Sigmund Freud","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7de7-b2ff-38bb408606e6","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Quantos quilates tem o ouro puro?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O ouro de 24 quilates \u00e9 considerado puro; classifica\u00e7\u00f5es inferiores indicam que outros metais comp\u00f5em parte da liga.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7abb-81fa-77ac224de29e","description":"24 quilates","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d55-93e3-a97c8649f20d","description":"22 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-72a5-a959-f368a2aa1484","description":"30 quilates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-74ac-8cc5-be659c1d0ec5","description":"12 quilates","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7df8-981c-134af227b013","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Para que serve principalmente o radar?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Radar \u00e9 a sigla para \u201cdetec\u00e7\u00e3o e localiza\u00e7\u00e3o por r\u00e1dio\u201d; o tempo que as ondas de r\u00e1dio refletidas levam para retornar pode revelar a que dist\u00e2ncia algo se encontra.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ed7-87f9-87b8132b499d","description":"Detec\u00e7\u00e3o de objetos","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7905-a6e2-943558d207c1","description":"Amplifica\u00e7\u00e3o de som","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a46-a42a-e9a42d5610e7","description":"Gera\u00e7\u00e3o de eletricidade","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ee7-b05c-c7712e2815a0","description":"Medindo a temperatura","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7941-af76-2231bbef62aa","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Que instrumento podemos usar para observar as estrelas?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"Um telesc\u00f3pio capta e concentra a luz, facilitando a observa\u00e7\u00e3o de estrelas distantes. Muitos telesc\u00f3pios de grandes observat\u00f3rios usam espelhos para captar essa luz.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7164-b2f5-8177b1ea36de","description":"Telesc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7903-921d-5d0118e2c133","description":"Perisc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-75c6-a021-d09f4eb0d25e","description":"Endosc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e88-b5b7-a537fd3ac34f","description":"Microsc\u00f3pio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-745c-85ae-d39c48b23ba8","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual teoria descreve o in\u00edcio do nosso universo?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A teoria do Big Bang descreve o universo se expandindo a partir de um estado extremamente quente e denso. O fundo c\u00f3smico de micro-ondas \u00e9 frequentemente descrito como o resplendor remanescente desse universo primitivo.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d0f-82c1-52d86a35ac4a","description":"Big Bang","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7205-a3f2-23596eb241a4","description":"Supernova","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7017-87ec-d83cb9038e33","description":"Modelo Padr\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ad0-a425-6b81007393cb","description":"Relatividade Especial","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7371-8467-f59ca2643541","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a causa direta do diabetes tipo I?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"No diabetes tipo I, o sistema imunol\u00f3gico destr\u00f3i as c\u00e9lulas beta produtoras de insulina no p\u00e2ncreas, o que faz com que a glicemia aumente.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d88-bdbd-dd4d2b3c157d","description":"Insulina insuficiente","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e45-a2e1-d36759dc9752","description":"Estrog\u00eanio insuficiente","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e40-8703-cc3414cd0d7f","description":"C\u00e1lcio insuficiente","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-760e-8ec5-14332b0c7927","description":"Falta de magn\u00e9sio","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c0d-9cf7-da5f4b87f7bb","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"O que \u00e9 a transi\u00e7\u00e3o da fase l\u00edquida para a fase s\u00f3lida?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O congelamento \u00e9 o processo inverso ao derretimento; a ebuli\u00e7\u00e3o e a condensa\u00e7\u00e3o s\u00e3o mudan\u00e7as de fase que envolvem um g\u00e1s.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7bfe-b12a-f4b6dad4cbb3","description":"Congelamento","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b1d-bdbd-efc5eff5bede","description":"Derretimento","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7de8-ba76-3cf9419d1895","description":"Ebul\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c1e-81dd-df39bd6ee6f1","description":"Condensa\u00e7\u00e3o","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-779e-9949-2adf3d330aeb","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama a pr\u00e1tica de cultivar plantas em l\u00edquidos, em vez de solo?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A hidroponia fornece nutrientes \u00e0s ra\u00edzes das plantas por meio de uma solu\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 base de \u00e1gua. O nome combina ra\u00edzes gregas que significam \u201c\u00e1gua\u201d e \u201ctrabalho\u201d.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-758a-88d0-9145c514f94b","description":"Hidroponia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-74e3-9f4b-eab7f7b446c3","description":"Aqu\u00f4nica","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-76e3-9642-570b0e8602c4","description":"Horticultura","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7141-a234-b4782421dafd","description":"Cultura aqu\u00e1tica","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-71d3-bd94-dadbf4f018df","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual \u00e9 a principal fonte de energia da Terra?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O Sol fornece a maior parte da energia que chega \u00e0 Terra, aquecendo o planeta e alimentando processos como o clima e a fotoss\u00edntese.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-711b-b41d-8442ac121591","description":"Sol","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7352-a312-d795d590fce3","description":"Lua","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-769b-a481-48cfa618fcd8","description":"V\u00eanus","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ad7-849f-aa8cd5dc16a7","description":"Alfa Centauri","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7397-82c1-d11cafb45694","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual dessas aves est\u00e1 extinta?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O dod\u00f4 vivia apenas na Ilha Maur\u00edcio; a ca\u00e7a e os animais introduzidos pelo homem contribu\u00edram para sua extin\u00e7\u00e3o.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7cce-8203-95e61c167c72","description":"Dodo","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7554-8ffb-40325a331118","description":"Coruja","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7e3d-9cdb-e1f31544f599","description":"Pintassilgo","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7ea4-8c9c-9ca45aa660e8","description":"Cegonha-preta","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d81-9c3a-4ff58744781e","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como se chama o filhote de ovelha?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As ovelhas s\u00e3o ruminantes, e seus filhotes s\u00e3o comumente chamados de cordeiros.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-788d-a5fb-79911ffd00fa","description":"Um cordeiro","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7c4f-af19-70015733327a","description":"Uma larva","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7365-b992-825285e6d668","description":"Uma lagarta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7b82-b1e1-2ad81cb2ded7","description":"Um alevino","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7dee-bd9c-e15c31b58f54","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Qual tecnologia foi desenvolvida inicialmente para as For\u00e7as Armadas dos EUA e agora \u00e9 usada para navega\u00e7\u00e3o?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O GPS foi desenvolvido pelo Departamento de Defesa dos EUA; seus sinais de sat\u00e9lite s\u00e3o agora utilizados em telefones, carros e dispositivos de mapeamento.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7f6e-a22d-1227d4ea471b","description":"GPS","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7d85-a4f2-7a2a8595e77b","description":"BPS","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae02-7a2b-87df-7846f6d2c8ec","description":"LPS","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae0