 doen\u00e7a sexualmente transmiss\u00edvel?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"A clam\u00eddia \u00e9 causada pela bact\u00e9ria Chlamydia trachomatis e geralmente \u00e9 cur\u00e1vel com antibi\u00f3ticos.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7a16-9acd-3d5ee734f9c9","description":"Clam\u00eddia","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7208-b63c-03be5c39845e","description":"Doen\u00e7a de Parkinson","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7edd-b8b4-8cef9bc5b771","description":"C\u00e2ncer de tireoide","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7980-a5e5-ca32f8587581","description":"Gastrite","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7878-8253-61f67784ea39","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Onde podemos encontrar estalactites?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"As estalactites se formam no teto das cavernas \u00e0 medida que os minerais se depositam; as estalagmites crescem para cima a partir do ch\u00e3o das cavernas.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7a35-a5fe-444b2d37d00e","description":"Em uma caverna","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7b67-9540-65ebcc069eb8","description":"No deserto","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7591-9a4b-2a678dce3ec9","description":"Em uma floresta","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7cf8-80db-1a04963d24be","description":"Na cozinha","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7b3f-8f0a-e392a15624e7","category":"01a2135e-b9ba-7fbd-8736-4a658c8d2151","question":"Como voc\u00ea chamaria um filhote de r\u00e3?","difficulty":1,"explanation":"O girino \u00e9 o est\u00e1gio larval aqu\u00e1tico da r\u00e3; \u00e0 medida que se desenvolve, ele desenvolve pernas e perde a cauda.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7021-b464-ed2f89e9627a","description":"Um girino","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7f68-b688-93ecb2256d40","description":"Um bezerro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a21904-ae03-7dfa-b3bd-7e5024d80c1e","description":"Um leit\u00e3o","correct_answer